WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:07.930
Consider a time in your life when you did
something that was so immensely embarrassing

00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:12.929
that you felt like the world would never take
you seriously again.

00:00:12.929 --> 00:00:18.179
Think of a time when a friend, partner, or
family member did something that hurt you

00:00:18.179 --> 00:00:24.330
so deeply that it made you question the meaning
of human connection.

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:31.179
Reflect on a time when you failed at something
that you tried so incredibly hard to accomplish

00:00:31.179 --> 00:00:38.220
that you felt you would never be able to move
on and feel good about yourself again.

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.910
Now observe yourself right now.

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:42.450
How do you feel?

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:48.550
Do you still feel any of those ways right
now because of those moments?

00:00:48.550 --> 00:00:55.030
Would you have been thinking about those moments
if I hadn’t just reminded you of them?

00:00:55.030 --> 00:01:00.120
Perhaps you are able to find a lingering memory
of them somewhere in the recesses of your

00:01:00.120 --> 00:01:07.710
subconscious mind, but the feelings associated
with them have lost most, if not all of their

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:11.720
weight on your current state a being.

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:19.790
Your feelings of happiness, sadness, excitement,
stress, love, hate and everything in between

00:01:19.790 --> 00:01:21.370
have all since reset.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.290
You have moved on.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:29.380
You have since experienced new moments that
have buried the old.

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:36.120
What you were once transfixed on, certain
that life was ruined because of, is now simply

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.450
a blurry memory.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:44.870
This is because you are a human and you are
forced to move on, whether you like it or

00:01:44.870 --> 00:01:45.970
not.

00:01:45.970 --> 00:01:52.200
As passengers aboard the train of time, we
are forced to leave moments and occurrences

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.200
behind us.

00:01:54.200 --> 00:02:00.630
This can be sad when fun and beautiful things
happen, but it is liberating when bad things

00:02:00.630 --> 00:02:04.300
happen to us or because of us.

00:02:04.300 --> 00:02:10.279
Leaving moments behind us is not to say that
the moments of our past don’t effect and

00:02:10.279 --> 00:02:17.409
mold who we are and who we will become, but
it is to say that they no longer solely control

00:02:17.409 --> 00:02:19.920
how we feel right now.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:27.739
And likewise, despite how good or bad or intense
this moment feels right now, it too will matter

00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:31.730
very little to our future self.

00:02:31.730 --> 00:02:38.079
No moment lasts forever and as such, no feeling
lasts forever.

00:02:38.079 --> 00:02:46.560
We will without doubt experience more sadness,
embarrassment, failure, stress, and mean-spiritedness

00:02:46.560 --> 00:02:48.769
in the future.

00:02:48.769 --> 00:02:56.560
But we will also experience more happiness,
wonder, pleasure, love, and positivity.

00:02:56.560 --> 00:03:02.620
These new moments will require our energy
and attention and as a result, the feelings

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:07.010
associated with the moments of the past will
dissolve into insubstantiality.

00:03:07.010 --> 00:03:08.010
Ultimately, time is the best medicine for
all wounds, both physical and mental.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:09.010
Just like a cut on your arm, with time and
a little bit of maintenance, an injury to

00:03:09.010 --> 00:03:10.010
your sense of self will heal over.

00:03:10.010 --> 00:03:11.010
Perhaps a light scar will remain like the
one you would receive on your arm, but it

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.010
too will fade over time.

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:13.519
Right now things may feel dismal.

00:03:13.519 --> 00:03:16.590
Perhaps you made a big mistake at work.

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:20.180
Perhaps you are going through a fight with
a friend or a partner.

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:26.500
Or perhaps you have done something really
foolish in front of lot of people.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:32.459
Whatever it may be, the feeling of it will
only last a short period of time.

00:03:32.459 --> 00:03:38.019
Eventually there will be something new that
you have to concern yourself with and this

00:03:38.019 --> 00:03:43.879
thing you are worried about right now will
no longer matter.

00:03:43.879 --> 00:03:50.129
No single moment defines who you are or how
you will experience life.

00:03:50.129 --> 00:03:55.900
Time will carry you onward and you will always
adapt to the fluctuations of life and return

00:03:55.900 --> 00:03:57.269
to your center.

00:03:57.269 --> 00:04:04.590
And so therefore, every time you experience
something negative, despite how much it may

00:04:04.590 --> 00:04:11.779
seem like it at the time, it most likely isn’t
going to ruin your life and you can take it

00:04:11.779 --> 00:04:38.259
a little less seriously.

